430
00:18:36,156 --> 00:18:37,075
EVERYTHING IS GREAT!

431
00:18:37,116 --> 00:18:38,618
EVERYTHING STAYS THE SAME!

432
00:18:38,659 --> 00:18:40,661
NOW, YOU GO AND UNPACK
'CAUSE IT'S BEEN THREE DAYS

433
00:18:40,703 --> 00:18:42,162
