AH! AH!

437
00:18:47,460 --> 00:18:48,920
( door shuts )

438
00:18:54,508 --> 00:18:59,806
YOU KNOW, I WAS THINKING,
WHAT IF I, UH, UNPACK HERE?

439
00:18:59,847 --> 00:19:01,724
THEN ALL YOUR STUFF
WOULD BE HERE.

440
00:19:03,684 --> 00:19:06,813
WELL...

441
00:19:06,854 --> 00:19:09,816
