451
00:19:37,927 --> 00:19:39,012
YES!

452
00:19:39,053 --> 00:19:39,679
YES!
OKAY!

453
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:41,097
YES!

454
00:19:42,181 --> 00:19:43,891
YES!

455
00:19:43,933 --> 00:19:47,186
YES. OKAY.
OKAY, WAIT.

456
00:19:47,227 --> 00:19:47,687
WAIT. WAIT. WAIT.

457
00:19:47,728 --> 00:19:48,395
OKAY.

458
00:19:48,437 --> 00:19:49,187
OKAY.
HERE'S YOUR KEY.

459
00:19:49,229 --> 00:19:50,690
OKAY.
HERE'S YOUR KEY.

460
00:19:50,731 --> 00:19:52,274
ALL RIGHT, NOW, YOU HAVE
