472
00:20:11,127 --> 00:20:12,545
OH, MY GOD. IT'S OLD.

473
00:20:12,586 --> 00:20:14,463
I LOVE YOU.

474
00:20:15,798 --> 00:20:17,717
I LOVE YOU.

475
00:20:17,758 --> 00:20:21,554
