THE DOOR RIGHT NOW?

476
00:20:26,559 --> 00:20:28,519
NO.

477
00:20:28,561 --> 00:20:31,189
YEAH, YEAH.
ME, NEITHER.

478
00:20:34,316 --> 00:20:35,442
HEY.

479
00:20:35,484 --> 00:20:37,403
HEY. SO, DID EVERYTHING
GO ALL RIGHT

480
00:20:37,444 --> 00:20:38,779
