481
00:20:38,821 --> 00:20:39,947
OH, YEAH.

482
00:20:39,989 --> 00:20:41,908
NO PROBLEMS. IT'S
ALL TAKEN CARE OF.

483
00:20:41,949 --> 00:20:43,409
