489
00:20:51,167 --> 00:20:52,877
OKAY. UM...

490
00:20:52,919 --> 00:20:54,045
I'LL GET MY SWEATER.

491
00:20:54,087 --> 00:20:55,295
OKAY.

492
00:20:57,215 --> 00:21:00,426
