WHAT?

496
00:21:08,559 --> 00:21:11,020
WE'RE STILL MARRIED.

497
00:21:11,062 --> 00:21:12,354
DON'T TELL RACHEL.

498
00:21:12,396 --> 00:21:13,647
SEE YOU LATER.

499
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:28,621
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

500
00:21:28,662 --> 00:21:29,997
KEY'S STUCK IN THE LOCK.

501
00:21:30,039 --> 00:21:31,290
I CAN FIX IT.
HOLD ON.

502
00:21:33,500 --> 00:21:34,877
WATCH OUT. WATCH OUT.

503
00:21:40,883 --> 00:21:42,802
STILL DOESN'T WORK.

504
00:21:42,843 --> 00:21:43,636
I'M NOT FINISHED.

505
00:21:43,677 --> 00:21:45,805
OH.

506
00:21:45,846 --> 00:21:49,183
[Captioned by
The Caption Center
WGBH Educational Foundation]

507
00:21:55,355 --> 00:21:56,398
NICE JOB, JOE.

508
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:58,525
YOU'RE QUITE
THE CRAFTSMAN.

